  message: "ADR-0051 annotation (WI-virav; annotate only -- no fold, no closure, no re-prioritisation). CONSUMER-SIDE MEMBER. CLAUSE: ADR-0051 s2, \"the receiver's type already has a home in Edge.meta['receiver_type_hint'] -- stamped by six analyzers and read by neither io_boundary nor taint\". NOTION: the consumers cannot tell whether the slot carries a namespace or a type, so they decide by ORTHOGRAPHY, while the field carrying the conformant TYPE goes unread at that seam. This is the remedy the axiom names rather than a violation of it, and it is what would let INV-kotob / WI-gudak's receiver_variable slots be bypassed instead of repaired."  # 246b
